    "prompt_excerpt": "FINISHED PROFESSIONAL INSTAGRAM AD — Instagram 4:5 — LANGUAGE: tr.\nDeliver a publishable, flattened social advertisement — typography, price hierarchy, CTA, and brand lockups integrated in the composition (not a blank background for later overlay).\n\nLANGUAGE LOCK:\n- Campaign language is tr. All user-visible slogans, headlines, CTAs, and supporting lines MUST be tr.\n- Do not invent or render English slogans/headlines/CTAs when language is tr.\n\nCAMPAIGN INTENT:\n- price_campaign\n- Primary focus: The elegance of the living room with the price advantage prominently displayed.\n- Emotional angle: Tarihi bir binada modern yaşamın keyfini çıkarın.\n\nCREATIVE DIRECTOR PRODUCTION BRIEF:\n- Objective: Highlight the unique blend of modern living in a historic setting with a compelling launch price.\n- Big Idea: Tarihi Dokusuyla Modern Yaşam\n- Hero: Modern. Şık. Tarihi.\n- Sales Hook: Unit 204 Lansman Fırsatı\n- Offer: $400,000 → $400,000\n- Supporting (max 2): Tarihi dokunuşlarla modern yaşam\n- CTA: Lansman Fiyatını Kaçırmayın\n\nDESIGN DIRECTION (creative freedom — no fixed panels):\n- Visual mood: Highlight the elegance of the interior with a focus on the blend of modern and historic elements.\n- Hierarchy: Price/offer may lead if that is the campaign intent; otherwise headline leads. Never compete with three equal-weight messages.\n- Typography character: Elegant and modern font to reflect the sophistication of the property.\n- Composition: Use a clean layout that allows the interior image to take center stage, with minimal text overlay.\n- Image treatment: Preserve real project architecture/photography — enhance atmosphere, do not redesign. Subtle grade toward premium RE editorial.\n- Contrast: High readability for primary message and CTA against the locked photograph\n- Brand presence: One verified project logo lockup — never invent or duplicate\n- CTA importance: Single clear CTA; visible and actionable, not tiny footer text\n- Information density: medium\n- Premium level: elevated\n- Freedo"
